"A suit of black bulletproof armor with lots of pockets.  The word SWAT is "
"emblazoned across the back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for CRIT Soldier Suit
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A suit of modern body-armor.  Strategically placed superalloy plates keep "
"the suit's weight minimal while Kevlar plates other areas and a lining of "
"soft neoprene pads areas for extra comfort.  Most importantly, this can be "
"worn comfortably under other armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bondage suit'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A suit of snug, black leather.  Has no pockets, but does feature an "
"abundance of unusually located zippers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hoodie'}
