"A waterproof hood made to be worn in bad weather.  Provides extra protection "
"from rain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "diver's watch", 'str_pl': "diver's watches"}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A waterproof, self-winding watch on a stainless steel watchband.  Tells the "
"time and current temperature.  Activate to check the digital thermometer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for C.R.I.T rec duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A waterproofed full-length duster coat.  Made with neoprene, comfort and "
"functionality meet together to form a fancy but sleek contemporary design.  "
"It has several pockets for storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for helmet netting
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A webbing of strings worn on a helmet, to attach camouflage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'breeches', 'str_pl': 'breeches'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of stiff yet baggy material.  "
"Comfortable, but lacks pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dress shirt'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A white button-down shirt with long sleeves.  Looks professional!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'beekeeping suit'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A white suit commonly worn by professional beekeepers with straps on your "
"ankles and wrists to prevent bees from flying in.  It's not a very tough "
"fabric, but it's lightweight and has plenty of storage thanks to a chest "
"pocket."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kittel', 'str_pl': 'kittels'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
