"temples with it on makes you feel very calm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool hoodie'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wool hooded shirt.  It offers decent protection against the cold.  The "
"front pocket offers both storage room and shelter for your hands."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sweater'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A wool shirt.  Provides warmth."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
