"Also called a \"bucket hat.\" Often used in the military.  Its wide brim "
"helps keep the sun out of your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'high-volume rucksack'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as a \"bigpack\", this rucksack is prized by pack rats but may "
"lead to a bad back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'purity ring'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as a promise ring, this ring is worn as a sign of chastity.  This "
"one bears the inscription, \"Love is patient.\""
msgstr ""

