"operators\".  Its cumbersome nature, the introduction of the derivative HK "
"USP series and the logistics of getting .45 ACP ammunition in theater doomed "
"this behemoth to US SOCOM armories.  Like the USP, the Mk 23 is a remarkably "
"reliable gun; someone could probably take out a nuclear equipped walking "
"tank with this in their holster."
