#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wing Chun is a Chinese martial art that began by selecting the easiest-to-"
"learn effective techniques from the various Shaolin animal forms.  It has a "
"high stance, with weight entirely on the rear leg.  Wing Chun focuses on "
"sensitivity to the opponent's direction of force, and flowing around it to "
"get back to hitting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Drunken Stumble' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a few quick steps, you can completely change your orientation and dodge "
"additional attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tai Chi Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are focused of defense and predicting your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, blocked damage reduced by 100%% Perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Footwork' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are make yourself harder to hit by bobbing and weaving as you move.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Snake's Sight' for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are patient and know where to hit your opponent for the best results.\n"
"\n"
"Perception increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.  Accuracy increased by "
"25%% of Perception but decreased by 25%% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Pounce' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are ready.  Attack and claim your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+25%% bonus to all damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are skilled at getting the most out of your weapons.  The term 'weapon' "
"might be very subjective,\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stand Your Ground' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are stalwart and will not budge against any threat.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Block attempts, -1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damage reduced by 50%% of "
"Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Fury' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You attack with an endless barrage of strikes.  The more you hit, the "
"stronger you become.\n"
"\n"
"+10%% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Momentum' for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can feel the rhythm as you move.  Not only are you harder to hit, but "
"your kicks are even more amazing!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Enables \"Spin Kick\" and \"Sweep Kick\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger's Strength' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  "
"Strength will break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"Strength increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25%% of Strength but decreased by 25%% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Strategy' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You fight by overwhelming your opponents with speedy strikes that are much "
"harder to defend against.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75%% of Dexterity but decreased by 75%% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Close Combat' for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You got your opponent right where you want them!\n"
"\n"
"+20%% bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Advanced Zui Quan' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of Zui Quan.  Your skills at dodging and "
"landing attacks are much better as a result.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, Accuracy increased by 15%% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chi-Sao Sensitivity' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of balance and technique.  This gives you a "
"better chance to avoid your opponent's attacks.\n"
"\n"
" Dodging Skill increased by 15%% of Perception.  Blocked damage reduced by "
"50%% of Perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Superior Positioning' for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have given up your defenses for a moment to increase the damage of your "
"attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10%% damage, -1 Block attempts.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tactical Retreat' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You moved and nullified the effects of Stand Your Ground!\n"
"\n"
"-2 Block attempts, +1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damaged increased by 50%% of "
"Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You never stop moving while performing the ginga.  This makes you very "
"mobile while fighting.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon's Knowledge' for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You plan your attack far in advance relying on your intuition instead of "
"your speed to strike true.\n"
"Intelligence increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25%% of Intelligence but decreased by 25%% of "
"Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Stalk' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You proudly stalk the shadows and preparing to pounce with unrelenting "
"fury.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Leopard's Pounce\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Evasion' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You stay low as you move, making it harder for enemies to pin you down.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 2 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You try to stay loose as possible when fighting to have more chances to "
"dodge.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're used to hand-to-creature fighting.  You know how to fight when "
"unarmed or with any weapon to a certain extent.  It's not stylish or "
"sporting, but it gets the job done."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Counter Chance' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You've seen your chance. Now strike back!\n"
"\n"
"+25%% Bash damage.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Centipede's Frenzy' for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your attacks are a blur of hands and legs that become faster as your strike "
"your opponents without rest.\n"
"\n"
"-4 move cost.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Unhindered' for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks are stronger if you are not holding anything in your hands.\n"
"\n"
"+33%% bash damage when not using a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Precision' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks strike at your opponents weakness with speed and precision "
"instead of brute force.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75%% of Dexterity but decreased by 75%% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Iron Skin' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"+6 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Ambush' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your evasiveness has left your opponent wide open to painful bite.\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Viper Bite\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Judo Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knowledge of grappling allows you to recover from knock down effects "
"instantly.\n"
"In addition, you can counter grabs and takedown attacks with a judo throw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Karate Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your no nonsense stance allows you hit more accurately.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chain Punch' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your punches are properly timed to give your opponent no rest from your "
"strikes.\n"
"\n"
"-10%% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Fencing Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your side stance minimizes the chances you will be harmed in a combat.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50%% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Ninjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training allows you to make no noise when attacking and less noise when "
"moving around.\n"
"\n"
"Melee and unarmed attacks generate 0 noise.  Moving generates 1/2 as much "
"noise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sōjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training grants better defense while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Krav Maga Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training makes it easier to land hits and fight multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +1 Block attempts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a constant threat that nothing can escape from.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bashing damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh reminder to never tease a predator.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a long lasting pain that your opponents will never forget.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns."
msgstr ""

