msgid ""
"'Drop the martial arts!', they said.  'Learn a skill for the REAL world!', "
"they said.  Well, you're about to show them!  SHOW THEM ALL!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Janitor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Your life has been a wreck.  Hopping place to place you finally found "
"a job at C.R.I.T… as a janitor of sorts.  The pay was good and you got some "
"sneak-peeks on some pretty cool stuff.  After all non-essential personel "
"were purged you found yourself stuck with nothing but the uniform they gave "
"you and your job's sign-bonus equipment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Janitor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Your life has been a wreck.  Hopping place to place you finally found "
"a job at C.R.I.T… as a janitor of sorts.  The pay was good and you got some "
"sneak-peeks on some pretty cool stuff.  After all non-essential personel "
"were purged you found yourself stuck with nothing but the uniform they gave "
"you and your job's sign-bonus equipment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Barbarian) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
