"You don't know why but you feel hopeful, everything feels new and you're "
"going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - Really Bad Day' for a female character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, "
"surrounded by fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really "
"fast."
msgstr ""

