"foot in the door when it is time to rebuild the nation!"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"WHEN I DID MY TIME.  We spoke to Dan Huang, the Chinese-American author of "
"the New York Times bestselling exposé \"When I Did my Time\", the story of "
"his three years living with his extended family in China, immersed in what "
"he describes as \"The ever-escalating anti-American propaganda of the East."
"\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's a real threat,\" said Huang.  \"They are being taught to hate our "
"freedom, and our technology.  Mark my words: there is going to be a "
"reckoning, and we need to be ready.\""
