"concentration center, and then we got on a bus to come here. The bus though, "
"it was rolled over by a giant monster, and many died. We made it out along "
"with a few others, and we kept going until we made it here. It wasn't much "
"farther, and for some reason the monster didn't chase us, just kept tearing "
"at the bus."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
