"Given the current context, we are willing to sell you a set of our "
"protective gear: gas mask, suit and gear, at a considerable discount.  We "
"will sell it for two of our coins.\n"
"\n"
"the intercom: Hmm wait, we might not have your size..."
msgstr ""

