"be useful as a chop-shop to rapidly dismantle large vehicles, and a forge "
"provides the resources to make charcoal.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Actions available through expansions are located in separate tabs of "
"the Camp Manager window.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: 3 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
